# Flutter

- Separate code into `lib/models/`, `lib/viewmodels/`, `lib/views/widgets/`, `lib/views/screens/`, `lib/services/`, and `lib/utils/`. [why: convention]
- Prefer `StatelessWidget` and `const` constructors. Use Riverpod and the shared `ThemeData`. [why: convention]
- Name files and directories in snake_case, types in UpperCamelCase, and members in lowerCamelCase. [why: convention]
- Order imports as `dart:*`, then `package:*`, then project-relative imports. [why: convention]
